{
  "slug": "prismatic-skills",
  "name": "Prismatic Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build and deploy Prismatic custom components, Code Native Integrations, and embedded marketplace experiences",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **7 agents**, **7 commands**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `boomi-migration` (This skill should be used when the user needs to analyze a Dell Boomi export, parse Boomi Component…), `component-patterns` (Architecture patterns, code generation guides, and reference documentation for building Prismatic custom components), `cyclr-migration` (This skill should be used when the user needs to analyze a Cyclr export, parse Cyclr JSON files,…), `embedded-patterns` (Reference documentation for embedding Prismatic's integration marketplace and workflow builder in a web application), `integration-patterns` (Architecture patterns, manifest usage, code generation guides, and reference documentation for building Prismatic Code Native Integrations), `migration-framework` (Core knowledge for migrating integrations from other platforms (Boomi, Cyclr) to Prismatic Code Native Integrations), `prismatic-api` (Prismatic API access patterns and GraphQL reference), `prismatic-docs` (This skill should be used when the user asks \"How do I...\", \"What is...\", \"How does X work…)\n- **Agents** (7): `cni-builder` (Builds Prismatic Code Native Integrations (CNI)), `component-builder` (Builds Prismatic custom components), `embedded-advisor` (Guides developers through embedding Prismatic's marketplace and workflow builder in their web application), `external-api-researcher` (Researches an external API by fetching and analyzing its documentation), `migration-analyzer` (Analyzes integration platform exports and converts them to a standard integration schema for CNI generation), `migration-reviewer` (Reviews generated CNI code against the original platform export to validate field accuracy, transformation completeness, and pattern compliance), `orby` (Use this agent when users need help interacting with the Prismatic platform - answering questions about their Prismatic…)\n- **Commands** (7): `build-component` (Build and deploy a Prismatic custom component), `build-integration` (Build and deploy a Prismatic Code Native Integration (CNI)), `embedded` (Set up Prismatic embedding — marketplace, workflow builder, or custom UI — in your web application), `migrate-integration` (Migrate an integration from another platform to a Prismatic Code Native Integration), `modify-integration` (Modify an existing Prismatic Code Native Integration), `orby` (Ask Orby, the Prismatic platform guide, a question or request about your Prismatic environment), `version` (Check which plugin version is loaded and whether the session is stale)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `prism`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prismatic-skills@claude-community` from `prismatic-io/prismatic-skills` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
